      <guid isPermaLink="false">33f58198e88d2b0786f7f98f132d5fd4efbd2b78</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 17:46:15 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694a82c1cec3e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd38eb2e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd3b9624.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd365a23.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd367669.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd364f84.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd36b2a1.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd39f91f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd36677c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd361a8d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd36f0b0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd384776.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd3a1980.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd39fd6f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd3a25d4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694aabd39f89a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694ac25134432.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694ac6cab1f05.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/694ac74da6ff8.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/699b5abfbd326.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Update&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The one handed sword string was removed because i just mainly used that to &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;learn how modifying them works&lt;/span&gt;, they didnt really feel all that good, and also for &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;better compatibility&lt;/span&gt; with my mod that i will release soon.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Mod works now again on 1.4.0+ when using the "Without TKMM" version&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed the Yiga quest from breaking&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Removal&lt;/em&gt;: One handed sword normal attack string was removed&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: The Master sword is able to break in its awakened state&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;Shinobi Mod that turns Link into a Real Shinobi, took a ton of time and effort and learning and creativity to make this but now its complete.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Once you wear a specific armor piece- Link gains abilities, i will List what each armor piece gives for a ability&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;                                      &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;        UPDATE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Sword Equip and Unequip has Improved Visuals&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/bitpit/equip.gif"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Now works on Version &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;1.1.0 - 1.4.3&lt;/span&gt; With Tkmm and also without Tkmm and Switch (tested)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Talisman effect is now&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt; standalone&lt;/span&gt;, so the yiga will keep their Red Talisman always&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The World &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;doesnt pause&lt;/span&gt; anymore when De/Activating the Master Sword&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Speed Wind effect&lt;/span&gt; lines to all the Shinobi actions (like running and double jumping, more visible while in shadows)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fixed all Bugs like the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;T-posing during backflip&lt;/span&gt; and the Raurus arm glow after every cutscene&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Landing in Water also &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;resets&lt;/span&gt; double jumps now&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No Double Jumps in &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;Shrines&lt;/span&gt; anymore -_-&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shinobi Mask-&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/bitpit/tp.gif"&gt;&lt;br&gt;A headband that gives temporary Sheikah knowledge.&lt;br&gt;it grants the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;ability to double jump, air dodge with&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;L&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;, or leap forward with&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;A&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;, the hood can be lowered by double-tapping&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;A&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;while standing still and holding&lt;/span&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt; (The Hylian Hood can also be lowered this way).&lt;br&gt;It &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Enables&lt;/span&gt; Master Sword Beams without full health too.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/bitpit/tp2.gif"&gt;&lt;br&gt;It also gives Link a whole Sheikah movement overhaul like with my other mod &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/450989"&gt;Sheikah Techniques&lt;/a&gt; but its not as much.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shinobi Chest Guard-&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/bitpit/ms_e91a9.gif"&gt;&lt;br&gt;An ancient chest piece made of Sheikah wisdom and &lt;br&gt;Zonai power, its fabric is torn and worn, yet it lets the&lt;br&gt;wearer &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;unleash the Master Sword's true power by&lt;br&gt;holding&lt;/span&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;ZL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt; &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;while standing still and double-tapping&lt;/span&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;A&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;It has Master Sword beam dmg &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;up&lt;/span&gt; too.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Zonai and Sheikah arm are also both &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Reactive&lt;/span&gt; to the new abilities.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(The sword goes into the Ultimate form, 60 Dmg and Unbreakable).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shinobi Tight's-&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/bitpit/wr_a676c.gif"&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sheikah wisdom is mixed with Zonai power in these &lt;br&gt;tights, enabling the wearer to sprint swiftly&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;across the surface of water.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;It &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;prevents&lt;/span&gt; fall dmg too.&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;How do you get the armor?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;Once you get the PurahPad inside your inventory, you will automatically get a quest when you are in game, follow the quest and you will obtain it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;And once you beat the quest you will get a Talisman that will give the same abilities also to some Vanilla Armor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;And if you sell the armor then you can buy it again in &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;CeCe’s&lt;/span&gt; shop.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;How Compatible is the mod?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod is mostly standalone and works with everything if placed at the top of TKMM. &lt;b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="87"&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;However&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, because it uses a custom ASB file to control its unique animations, it will clash with big mods like Challenge Mode or DAR. Since ASB files are a nightmare to merge manually, those mods will likely lose some of their animation or attack edits if used together. Same with Ainb- but that file controls more like abilities like other Armor ability mods&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For Sheikah Techniques, you shouldn't play them together, it will feel messy, i recommend to chose only one or the other here.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h1 class="SelectedElement"&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Mod Supports both &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;English and German&lt;/span&gt;, and for Game versions its only &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;1.1.0 - 1.4.3&lt;/span&gt; Both with and without Tkmm and on Switch (Tested)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;Install Insturctions&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Emulator&lt;/span&gt;: Open the zip file and then right click totk and place the mod in Mod Data Location&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Switch&lt;/span&gt;: Open the zip and search the "romfs" folder and place it in "atmosphere\content\0100F2C0115B6000" on your sdcard, and then search the exefs folder and convert the .pxhtxt file for the version you're playing on with &lt;a href="https://github.com/3096/ipswitch"&gt;ipswitch&lt;/a&gt; and make sure you're on atmosphere 1.12.1 or higher.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;To merge with other mods&lt;/span&gt;, download the mod merger: &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/linkfilter?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftotkmods.github.io%2Ftkmm%2Fdownloads%2F&amp;follow=true" target="_blank"&gt;TKMM&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Theres also options for different talisman color or disable the Glow/God-Voices/Cape, but for that you will need to install the .tkcl with &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/tools/17165"&gt;TKMM&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Watch the whole Video if you want to see everything that the Armor does but there's two small things i didn't say and that's that Link is also able to Jump cancel out of Sword Flurry Rushes and that 2 Handed Swords are faster.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;My &lt;a href="https://ko-fi.com/catzy123" target="_blank"&gt;Ko-fi&lt;/a&gt;, if you want to support me making more mods like these &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Have fun with the mod!</description>
