    <item>
      <title>ITT! - Intu's Tips and Tricks!</title>
      <author>intu</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/730779</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/730779#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">3e467b635b7ee813177d5ad497e6a94b4ae60193</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 11:57:22 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ada129e1b057.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad9f9a4cd33b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad9f9d802531.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;If you enjoy the mod, check out my other mods!&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;If you enjoy &lt;b&gt;this&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;mod, comment some of your own tips!&amp;nbsp; (You'll be credited)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;I'm always on the look out for new hints to add to this mod!&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ITT! - Intu's Tips and Tricks!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;I was &lt;b&gt;today years old&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;(&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;10 &lt;/span&gt;/ &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;22&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;/ &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;26&lt;/span&gt;) when I learned about these &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;63&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tips and Tricks!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I &lt;b&gt;guarantee&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;this mod will &lt;b&gt;teach you something new.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Overview&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ITT &lt;/b&gt;is a collection of &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;63 &lt;/span&gt;Tips, Tricks, and Hints &lt;/b&gt;that I compiled by &lt;a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/tearsofthekingdom/comments/16enax5/whats_on_your_totk_cheat_sheet/" target="_blank"&gt;reading people's stories and experiences on Reddit.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;I genuinely didn't know about the &lt;b&gt;majority &lt;/b&gt;of these tricks!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;They are added to the existing &lt;b&gt;pool of hints&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;in the vanilla game, which are cycled through on the &lt;b&gt;Loading Screen!&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;They also follow &lt;i&gt;Vanilla Progression&lt;/i&gt;, so, for example, tips and tricks regarding &lt;b&gt;The Depths&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;will only unlock after visiting The Depths! Or tips regarding certain Enemies, or Death Events, or Story Events, will only appear once those things have been discovered!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Anything from &lt;b&gt;rare item locations&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;to &lt;b&gt;combat tips&lt;/b&gt;, this mod adds something that &lt;b&gt;every player will find useful&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;And the best part? It's all &lt;b&gt;Spoiler/Lore Friendly&lt;/b&gt;! I re-wrote each tip to flow with TOTK's original cadence and tone, while &lt;b&gt;guiding players towards new objectives&lt;/b&gt;--all the while &lt;b&gt;avoiding major spoilers&lt;/b&gt;!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Let me know what you think in the &lt;b&gt;comments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;or on &lt;b&gt;Discord &lt;/b&gt;@ intuistic.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What's Changed?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Loading Screen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;63&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Tips, Tricks, and Hints have been added to the Loading Screen.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;They are unlocked dynamically, through exploration, combat, and story events.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;They are written to be Spoiler/Lore friendly for new players, so nothing seems cheaty.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can install the mod whenever! The new &lt;b&gt;Tips, Tricks, and Hints&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;will dynamically unlock themselves based on &lt;b&gt;where you are in the game&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;what you have done!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;To-Do?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;Depends.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;Add more Tips! (Comment Some More and Get Credited!)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Reporting Bugs&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;Here is an acceptable format for reporting bugs either in the Comments or my Discord DMs!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Screenshot&lt;/b&gt; (If Possible/Applicable)&lt;b&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Description:&lt;/b&gt; Describe what doesn't look or feel right.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Most Important - EXACT TEXT OR DIALOGUE, WORD FOR WORD.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Game Version &lt;/b&gt;(i.e 1.2.1, 1.4.2, etc.)&lt;b&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Emulator + Version:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Installation&lt;/h3&gt;This mod was made and tested on &lt;b&gt;TOTK 1.4.2&lt;/b&gt;. Using &lt;b&gt;TKMM&lt;/b&gt;, it would most likely work in &lt;b&gt;1.4.3&lt;/b&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;However&lt;/b&gt;, this mod &lt;b&gt;probably will work&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;on &lt;b&gt;ALL&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;versions using &lt;b&gt;TKMM&lt;/b&gt;, because of how simple it is, I believe TKMM is enough to make it compatible, but it needs testing! Let me know in the comments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Install the latest &lt;b&gt;.zip &lt;/b&gt;file.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Unzip your &lt;b&gt;.zip&lt;/b&gt; file.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Load the &lt;b&gt;.tkcl &lt;/b&gt;file into &lt;b&gt;TKMM&lt;/b&gt;, and enjoy!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Credits&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/tearsofthekingdom/comments/16enax5/whats_on_your_totk_cheat_sheet/" target="_blank"&gt;The TOTK Community on Reddit!&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The catalyst that sparked this mod's creation&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;More To Be Added - Suggest your favorite Tips and Tricks to have them show up in game!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(You'll be credited)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/itt_-_intu_s_tips_and_tricks_.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <category>Misc</category>
      <category>UI</category>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>SidLink - The Prince &amp; His Paladin</title>
      <author>intu</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/730710</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/730710#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">9fc0f1ca5da7bd253713725d043fd304b6465288</guid>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ada124bc8c7d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad98bb016efb.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad98b453eb0a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad991253414f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad991321e9be.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad99837adc18.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad99846b5238.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad99871a5de7.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;If you enjoy the mod, send me screenshots of your favorite moments!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I'll feature them on the mod page.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TPHP - The Prince &amp; His Paladin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;I have read &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;2,713 &lt;/span&gt;lines &lt;/b&gt;of dialogue during the creation of this mod.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Over &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;750 &lt;/span&gt;lines&lt;/b&gt; of that dialogue has been re-written in some way.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;Without further ado, I present my fan-project: &lt;b&gt;TPHP&lt;/b&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A &lt;i&gt;MxM Dialogue Overhaul&lt;/i&gt; between &lt;b&gt;Sidon&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;Link&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Overview&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TPHP &lt;/b&gt;is my attempt at realizing a world where &lt;b&gt;Sidon &lt;/b&gt;never stopped &lt;br&gt;crushing on our favorite blonde protagonist!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Yona &lt;/b&gt;has been re-written as the supportive, kind childhood friend &lt;br&gt;whom &lt;b&gt;Sidon &lt;/b&gt;had looked up to all his life, along with his older sister, &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mipha&lt;/b&gt;. This is actually canon: in "&lt;i&gt;Two Sisters of Different Blood,&lt;/i&gt;" &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sidon &lt;/b&gt;writes that he had two big sisters, "&lt;i&gt;one by birth and one by &lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;chance,&lt;/i&gt;" and that he "&lt;i&gt;was in awe of them both.&lt;/i&gt;"&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I tried to take a light-handed approach--not going too overboard--with &lt;br&gt;my edits, preserving the romantic subtext that was already present in &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TOTK&lt;/b&gt;, but simply shining light over it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;There are bound to be bugs, or lines I missed. See "Reporting Bugs".&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Let me know in the &lt;b&gt;comments&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;issues tab&lt;/b&gt;, or on &lt;b&gt;Discord &lt;/b&gt;@ intuistic.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What's Changed?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tons.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;+&lt;/b&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Named Zora NPCs&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;5 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Named NPCs Outside of Zora's Domain&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;6 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Scripted Events&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;A handful of &lt;b&gt;Easter Eggs!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;An &lt;b&gt;unholy amount&lt;/b&gt; of text no one will ever read...&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;Menus, Character Descriptions, UI...&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;Starting a brand-new game is recommended to experience the new changes, as I began editing from the moment you meet &lt;span class="Spoiler"&gt;Purah at Lookout Landing!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Other than that first interaction, if you have a save that hasn't met Yona, yet, that will also work fine!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(You can install the mod whenever, even after beating Zora's Domain, but you'll miss a lot of content)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;To-Do?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;Depends.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;Custom Cutscene Audio?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;Custom Dialogue Trees?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;Custom Quests?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i&gt;More &lt;b&gt;Easter Eggs&lt;/b&gt;?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;Comment below or DM me what you'd like to see added.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Reporting Bugs&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;Here is an acceptable format for reporting bugs either in the Comments or my Discord DMs!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Screenshot&lt;/b&gt; (If Possible/Applicable)&lt;b&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Description:&lt;/b&gt; Describe what doesn't look or feel right.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Most Important - EXACT TEXT OR DIALOGUE, WORD FOR WORD.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Game Version &lt;/b&gt;(i.e 1.2.1, 1.4.2, etc.)&lt;b&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Emulator + Version:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Installation&lt;/h3&gt;This mod was made and tested on TOTK 1.4.2. Using TKMM, it would most likely work in 1.4.3. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;However, this mod will &lt;b&gt;probably not work&lt;/b&gt; on earlier versions, try it and let me know.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I only have access to &lt;b&gt;1.4.2&lt;/b&gt;, so I can only develop for &lt;b&gt;1.4.2&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Install the latest &lt;b&gt;.zip &lt;/b&gt;file.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Unzip your &lt;b&gt;.zip&lt;/b&gt; file.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Load the &lt;b&gt;.tkcl &lt;/b&gt;file into &lt;b&gt;TKMM&lt;/b&gt;, and enjoy!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Credits&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/3347570"&gt;antisthetic&lt;/a&gt; - For the &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/wips/93080"&gt;inspiration &lt;/a&gt;to start this project. &lt;3&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/1704241"&gt;banan039&lt;/a&gt; - For his amazing tool, &lt;a href="https://github.com/SolidLink95/TotkBits" target="_blank"&gt;TOTKBits&lt;/a&gt; (GitHub Link).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/4593678"&gt;cargocult&lt;/a&gt; - For his amazing tool, &lt;a href="https://github.com/cargocult-mods/TOTK-event-editor" target="_blank"&gt;TOTK-Event-Editor&lt;/a&gt; (GitHub Link).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/4023083"&gt;Porroman420&lt;/a&gt; - For his amazing tool, &lt;a href="https://github.com/Porroman420/Tears-of-the-Kingdom---Tag-tool-helper/tree/main" target="_blank"&gt;TOTK TagInserter&lt;/a&gt; (GitHub Link).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/5016232"&gt;Me &lt;/a&gt;- For my amazing Custom MSBT Editor that I made mid-way through this project.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please check out their GameBanana and/or GitHub projects and give them some love. &lt;3&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Note: &lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;I made a custom MSBT editor for &lt;b&gt;personal use&lt;/b&gt; with the help of AI. &lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;All it did was let me organize the files I wanted to edit in a cleaner, orderly way, connect NPC Names and Quest Names to Dialogue Trees, and see what my edits would look like in-game without having to:&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Save, Package, Load Mod, Load Game, Find Edit, Verify Edit, Save, Close, Repeat.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;The planning, writing, troubleshooting, and bug-fixing were all my own, and AI did not touch a single file that I have shared Online.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;This is an unofficial fan mod. The Legend of Zelda, its characters and artwork are property of Nintendo. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod is not affiliated with or endorsed by Nintendo. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sidon official artwork from The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom © Nintendo&lt;br&gt;Used for non-commercial fan purposes only; I do not own it.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/tphp_v1.zip" type="application/zip"/>
