      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/687daf986356f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/687daf9bc5808.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/687daf9a2fa8e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/687daf9ba6950.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/687daf9bbc525.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Version 1.4.0+ support&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TotK version 1.4.0+ support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can now finally use this mod on versions 1.4.0, 1.4.2 and 1.4.3.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This version also includes a bunch of misc changes to Gerudo dialogue that was incorrectly changed or just didn't get changed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;A dialogue fix for &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/wips/80967"&gt;Linkle&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="//gamebanana.com/mods/451851" class="SelectedElement"&gt;Rinkuru/Linkle/Link female Pronouns and Dialogue&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;missed a lot of dialogue and seems to no longer be updated, so this mod was created to fix most of those mistakes and create better immersion for other people who noticed these issues.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;This mod is now included in the official &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/wips/80967"&gt;Linkle mod&lt;/a&gt;, you don't have to install it separately.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;This mod is definitely not perfect!&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you find any missed dialogue, incorrectly changed dialogue, grammar mistakes, or just if you have suggestions, please report them in the comments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;DISCLAIMERS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;I can't speak any other languages so I can't make this mod in any other languages, please don't ask me to; however anyone is welcome to use this mod as a base when making a version for a different language.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;AN UPDATE IS IN THE WORKS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Now that the mod has been out for a while, it's clear that people want a version that properly adds Linkle into the story. I will most likely be making a version of the mod with that in mind, however it&amp;nbsp; will take a while because that requires rewriting&amp;nbsp;almost all of the dialogue I've already changed. It shouldn't take as long as last update though, since I've created a tool to speed up development. (Let me know if anyone wants me to post it.)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Other languages:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;French - &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/729398"&gt;Linkle - French Dialogue Fix&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;by TiffaMoji</description>
